The Interaction library
There are some types that must be shared among all microservices. If the internal
communication is implemented with either remoting or WCF, each microservice must
expose an interface with all the methods other microservices call. Such interfaces must be
shared among all microservices. Moreover, with all communication interfaces, the classes
that implement the messages must also be shared among all microservices (or among some
subsets of them). Therefore, all of these structures are declared in external libraries that are
referenced by the microservices.
